/**
 * printSkillV2 — pulled skill rendering for the terraform path. Consumes
 * the `NormalizedSkill` that `skillFromTf` produces and emits an
 * `apps/<app>/skills/<refName>.ts` authoring file: `skill` with tools
 * as `catalog` tokens (self-app) or a TODO literal (foreign apps — their
 * catalog may not exist in this workspace) and tool fields as
 * `catalog.<app>.fields.<key>`.
 *
 * Named identically to (but distinct from, different file/path) the legacy
 * AST-based `printSkillV2` in `print-skill.ts` — same precedent as
 * `entities/agent/deserializer/print-agent.ts` vs. `print-agent-v2.ts`.
 *
 * Unresolved field and automation platform ids print as `unsafePlatformId(...)`.
 */
